Physical persistence structures provide the physical representation of logical enterprise information.

They faithfully represent:

- Enterprise Information Categories
- Enterprise Authorities
- Enterprise Ownership
- Enterprise Stewardship
- Enterprise Relationships
- Enterprise Constraints
- Enterprise Information Boundaries
- Enterprise Logical Organization

Physical persistence structures organize enterprise information.

They do not redefine enterprise semantics.

