# Enterprise Principle

Physical persistence faithfully represents logical organization.

Physical representation shall never redefine:

- Enterprise Concepts
- Enterprise Information Categories
- Enterprise Authorities
- Enterprise Ownership
- Enterprise Stewardship
- Enterprise Relationships
- Enterprise Constraints
- Enterprise Information Boundaries
- Enterprise Logical Organization

Physical representation implements logical organization.

It does not create, modify, or redefine logical organization.

